<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide coils with [nonferrous][copper] [or] [aluminum] tubes of<MET> 10 mm</MET><ENG> 3/8 inch</ENG> minimum diameter with [copper] 
[or] [aluminum] fins that are mechanically bonded or soldered to the tubes.  [Protect coil in accordance with 
paragraph CORROSION PROTECTION.]  Provide galvanized steel or aluminum casing.  Avoid contact of dissimilar metals.  
