area.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide units of capacities less than<MET> 39.5 kW</MET><ENG> 135,000 Btu/h</ENG> with a maximum AHRI sound rating of [85][_____] dB 
when rated in accordance with <RID>ANSI/AHRI 270</RID>.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
]<SPT><TTL>Air-Cooled Condenser</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide Unit in accordance with <RID>ANSI/AHRI 460</RID> and conform to the requirements of <RID>UL 1995</RID>.  Provide factory fabricated, 
